important event of her life.

256
00:17:52,697 --> 00:17:53,990
Oh, dear.

257
00:17:54,115 --> 00:17:57,786
Daddy, l made something for you.
You're gonna love this.

258
00:17:57,911 --> 00:18:01,706
lt's a hug. Next time you fly
you won't have to be scared.

259
00:18:01,706 --> 00:18:04,084
She's made you a parachute.

260
00:18:04,209 --> 00:18:06,294
That's very clever, dear.

261
00:18:07,587 --> 00:18:11,216
Jack, get away from there.
What have l told you about open windows?

262
00:18:11,299 --> 00:18:14,511
Keep this window closed.
l've told you this a hundred times.

263
00:18:14,511 --> 00:18:18,682
