324
00:24:53,910 --> 00:24:55,286
The window.

325
00:25:08,717 --> 00:25:12,303
''Dear Peter, your presence is required
at the request of your children.''

326
00:25:15,390 --> 00:25:16,182
''Kindest personal regards,
JAS Hook...

327
00:25:16,182 --> 00:25:20,186
''Kindest personal regards,
JAS Hook...

328
00:25:20,186 --> 00:25:21,813
Captain.''

329
