339
00:26:00,685 --> 00:26:02,979
My children are missing.

340
00:26:02,979 --> 00:26:07,192
Yes, but the literary history
of the family and everything suggests--

341
00:26:07,192 --> 00:26:11,112
- Well, let's hope so.
- l've forgotten how to fly.

342
00:26:11,196 --> 00:26:13,198
Yes, well, one does.

343
00:26:14,282 --> 00:26:16,201
Good night, then, ma'am, sir.

344
00:26:19,204 --> 00:26:21,706
No more happy thoughts.

345
00:26:23,208 --> 00:26:24,709
