346
00:26:38,807 --> 00:26:41,393
Nothing we can do.
The police will do everything--

347
00:26:41,518 --> 00:26:44,020
The police can do nothing.

348
00:26:44,104 --> 00:26:47,107
Oh, really? Maybe we should
call the American police.

349
00:26:47,190 --> 00:26:51,194
ln a crisis, we English always
make a cup of tea. Moira, would you?

350
00:26:51,194 --> 00:26:52,904
- Tea?
- Of course, Gran.

351
00:26:52,988 --> 00:26:55,990
Don't forget to warm the pot.

352
00:26:56,116 --> 00:26:57,993
