American parents, Hank and Jane Banning.

362
00:27:34,404 --> 00:27:37,407
You were 12-- nearly 13.

363
00:27:37,490 --> 00:27:39,284
l mean before that.

364
00:27:39,409 --> 00:27:41,619
There's nothing before that.

365
00:27:42,704 --> 00:27:44,914
Try, Peter. Do try.

366
00:27:47,417 --> 00:27:48,793
Nothing.

367
00:27:53,089 --> 00:27:56,301
You know, when l was young...

368
00:27:58,386 --> 00:28:01,389
no other girl held your favor
the way l did.

369
00:28:03,892 --> 00:28:07,187
l half expected you to alight
on the church and forbid my vows...

370
00:28:07,187 --> 00:28:09,189
on my wedding day.

371
00:28:10,315 --> 00:28:12,692
l wore a pink satin sash.

372
00:28:15,904 --> 00:28:17,906
But you didn't come.

373
00:28:19,407 --> 00:28:20,784
Grandma--

374
00:28:21,910 --> 00:28:26,081
Yes, l was an old lady
when l wrapped you in blankets...

375
00:28:26,081 --> 00:28:27,999
a grandmother...

376
00:28:28,083 --> 00:28:29,084
with my 13-year-old granddaughter
