421
00:32:34,496 --> 00:32:38,583
Oh, no. lt's finally happened.
l'm having a total nervous breakdown.

422
00:32:38,583 --> 00:32:40,418
Peter, follow me
and all will be well.

423
00:32:40,418 --> 00:32:43,505
Or l'm dying.
l'm heading towards the white light.

424
00:32:43,588 --> 00:32:46,383
l've left my body.
See, there's my house way down there.

425
00:32:46,508 --> 00:32:48,802
There are my feet.
Oh, my God. Where are we going?

426
00:32:48,885 --> 00:32:51,513
- To save your children, of course.
- How do you know about my kids?

427
00:32:51,596 --> 00:32:54,599
Everybody knows. Captain Hook's
got them and you've got to fight him.

428
00:32:54,682 --> 00:32:56,101
Let's fly!

429
00:33:02,816 --> 00:33:05,610
lt is true, then.
You did grow up.

430
00:33:08,279 --> 00:33:11,700
l drank poison for you.
You used to call me Tink.

431
00:33:11,700 --> 00:33:14,786
- Have you forgotten everything?
- Are you in there, little bug?

432
00:33:14,786 --> 00:33:17,414
l'm not a bug.
l'm a fairy.

433
00:33:21,918 --> 00:33:24,087
l do not believe in fairies.

434
00:33:24,212 --> 00:33:26,715
Every time someone says,
''l do not believe in fairies''...

435
00:33:26,798 --> 00:33:29,509
somewhere there's a fairy
that falls down dead.

436
00:33:29,592 --> 00:33:31,511
l do not believe in fairies!

437
00:33:42,981 --> 00:33:45,191
Oh, my God,
l think l killed it.

438
00:33:46,609 --> 00:33:49,279
Are you alive, little bug?
Look out!

439
00:33:49,404 --> 00:33:52,407
Clap your hands, Peter.

440
00:33:52,407 --> 00:33:54,409
lt's the only way to save me.

441
00:33:57,120 --> 00:33:58,580
Louder.

442
00:33:59,497 --> 00:34:01,499
Louder, Peter!

443
00:34:02,917 --> 00:34:04,419
Okay, l'm clapping!

444
00:34:06,504 --> 00:34:08,715
Oh, God, you're alive.

445
00:34:08,715 --> 00:34:11,217
All right, now.
Who am l?

446
00:34:13,219 --> 00:34:14,596
You're, um--

447
00:34:18,683 --> 00:34:21,811
You're a Freudian hallucination
having something to do with my mother...

448
00:34:21,895 --> 00:34:24,189
and l don't know why you have wings,
but you have very lovely legs...

449
00:34:24,314 --> 00:34:26,608
and you're a very nice tiny person,
and what am l saying?

450
00:34:26,691 --> 00:34:29,194
l don't know who my mother was, l'm
an orphan, and l've never taken drugs...

451
00:34:29,319 --> 00:34:31,196
because l missed the '60s,
l was an accountant.

452
00:34:31,988 --> 00:34:33,406
Guess again.

453
00:34:35,492 --> 00:34:37,994
Oh, look. Stars.

454
00:34:37,994 --> 00:34:41,498
That's right, Peter. Second star to
the right and straight on till morning.

455
00:34:43,708 --> 00:34:45,502
Neverland.

456
00:35:46,688 --> 00:35:49,816
What a nightmare. Moira!

457
00:36:03,496 --> 00:36:05,707
Hear ye, hear ye!

458
00:36:05,790 --> 00:36:08,501
Roll out. Roll out!

459
00:36:14,382 --> 00:36:17,302
Neverbirds!
Three for a farthing.

460
00:36:17,385 --> 00:36:19,804
Pies for sale.

461
00:36:19,888 --> 00:36:21,806
Lovely fish !

462
00:36:21,890 --> 00:36:23,516
Fresh fish!

463
00:36:23,600 --> 00:36:27,103
We keep the eyes in
so they'll see you through the week.

464
00:36:32,192 --> 00:36:35,612
Excuse me.
ls there a pay phone around here?

465
00:36:35,695 --> 00:36:37,989
- That is so real.
- Peter, get back here!

466
00:36:37,989 --> 00:36:39,616
Get down, get low.

467
00:36:39,699 --> 00:36:41,117
Hide!

468
00:36:42,994 --> 00:36:46,206
Hello.
lf it ain't the Mother lnferior.

469
00:36:46,289 --> 00:36:48,208
Gentlemen,
l'm looking for someone.

470
00:36:48,291 --> 00:36:51,711
l fancy them shiny shoes
for my booty.

471
00:36:51,795 --> 00:36:53,380
You can get them at Armani.

472
00:36:54,714 --> 00:36:58,009
Tink, help me!

473
00:36:58,093 --> 00:37:00,595
Tinkerball-- Tinkerbun--

474
00:37:00,720 --> 00:37:02,514
Don't get no blood on them boots!

475
00:37:02,597 --> 00:37:04,307
They's mine!

476
00:37:04,391 --> 00:37:06,184
Help me, Tinkerbell!

477
00:37:06,893 --> 00:37:08,895
You pixie devil!

478
00:37:12,899 --> 00:37:15,485
Oh, please don't.
l have a bad back.

479
00:37:16,820 --> 00:37:18,697
Ya pixie devil !

480
00:37:26,788 --> 00:37:28,707
Are you related to Mighty Mouse?

481
00:37:34,087 --> 00:37:36,715
lf you insist on seeing Hook
and desire to be alive when you do so...

482
00:37:36,798 --> 00:37:38,383
do exactly what l say.

483
00:37:38,508 --> 00:37:41,719
Your left arm is dead,
it hangs lifeless at your side.

484
00:37:41,803 --> 00:37:45,390
Lean on the crutch!
Left foot turned in.

485
00:37:45,515 --> 00:37:48,602
Tilt your head and glare
with your good eye.

486
00:37:48,685 --> 00:37:51,187
Now crack your mouth and drool.

487
00:37:51,312 --> 00:37:53,606
Now growl. Growl !

488
00:37:53,690 --> 00:37:55,191
- How are you?
- Not bad, and you?

489
00:37:55,316 --> 00:37:57,110
- Not bad!
- All right!

