- l want to see the scar.

576
00:43:59,806 --> 00:44:01,391
The hypertrophy.

577
00:44:01,516 --> 00:44:05,312
Here's the scar where you sliced him
during the Tiger Lily incident.

578
00:44:05,395 --> 00:44:08,398
- That's my appendix.
- What's this?

579
00:44:08,398 --> 00:44:08,690
Fairy footprints. He's Peter Pan
or l've got a dead man's dinghy.

580
00:44:08,690 --> 00:44:16,406
Fairy footprints. He's Peter Pan
or l've got a dead man's dinghy.

581
00:44:16,406 --> 00:44:18,700
ls it you?

582
00:44:18,700 --> 00:44:21,411
My great and worthy opponent?

583
00:44:22,579 --> 00:44:24,581
But it can't be.

584
00:44:25,707 --> 00:44:27,208
Not this pitiful, spineless, pasty,
bloated codfish l see before me.

585
00:44:27,208 --> 00:44:32,297
Not this pitiful, spineless, pasty,
bloated codfish l see before me.

586
00:44:32,297 --> 00:44:34,591
You're not even
a shadow of Peter Pan.

