701
00:54:05,203 --> 00:54:07,497
We kill pirates.

702
00:54:08,790 --> 00:54:10,792
l'm not a pirate.

703
00:54:10,917 --> 00:54:13,420
lt so happens l am a lawyer.

704
00:54:14,379 --> 00:54:16,089
Kill the lawyer!

705
00:54:17,215 --> 00:54:19,092
